From: licko <licko@spark>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 21:06:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(B-cpp): screen-share companion mode + sampling defaults
 + Q4_K_M
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Frontend (omni-app.js, omni.html):
- Add screenShareBtn (getDisplayMedia) toggling camera <-> screen
- screen mode auto-injects companion prompt, forces max_slice_nums=1,
  disables HD vision, throttles frames to ~0.5fps
- preparePayload default config: listen_prob_scale=0.3, force_listen_count=0
  (without these, F16/Q8/Q4 all stay in LISTEN forever — verified)
- audio-duplex-app.js: same sampling defaults

config.json:
- Switch llm_model F16 -> Q4_K_M (latency baseline run; user tested Q8 sweet
  but currently profiling Q4 for max smoothness)

Backups kept as *.bak-* (gitignored).
